[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6020677446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124228#issuecomment-6020677446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124228","id":6020677446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZtw_Rg","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T16:25:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T16:25:00Z","body":"@neikeq https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120070#discussion_r3692606875\r\n> Hmm, we might want to increase this. Or continue loading the new ALC after 1s as you do here, but continue attempting to unload the old ALC in the background and only displaying the warning after a longer timeout.\r\n\r\nThe only thing we can do from our side to continue unloading the assembly is to call:\r\n```C#\r\n                    GC.Collect(GC.MaxGeneration, GCCollectionMode.Forced);\r\n                    GC.WaitForPendingFinalizers();\r\n```\r\nWhich will be called automatically by the GC anyway, so I guess it will continue trying to unload it in the background. But I increased the timeout slightly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6020677446/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6024009461","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124228#issuecomment-6024009461","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124228","id":6024009461,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZw8W9Q","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T19:36:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T19:36:13Z","body":"> Which will be called automatically by the GC anyway, so I guess it will continue trying to unload it in the background. But I increased the timeout slightly.\r\n\r\nIt's more about not printing the warning if the assembly just naturally takes a long time to unload. But I don't know if this would really be an issue in practice.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"h